<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span><span id="A1.F4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Per-epoch evaluation for proposal.</span>
Blue denotes fill-in-the-blank (FB), pink denotes question answering (QA), and green denotes adversarial attack (AA).
Solid lines indicate forget scores, while dashed lines indicate retain scores.
Forget scores are reported for FB, QA, and AA; retain scores are reported for FB and QA.
